      ":question/problem": "![](images/79/79c527b68d1bf5de71ce4301fcc51055bf30e3d7258e1114f490fe783c3772d8.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $PQ^(\u2015)\u2245PR^(\u2015)$ and $SQ^(\u2015)\u2245SR^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u2220PQS\u2245\u2220PRS$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $PQ^(\u2015)\u2245PR^(\u2015)$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 2 | $SQ^(\u2015)\u2245SR^(\u2015)$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 3 | $PS^(\u2015)\u2245PS^(\u2015)$ | {{field-3}} |\n| 4 | $\u25b3PQS\u2245\u25b3PRS$ | {{field-4}} |\n| 5 | $\u2220PQS\u2245\u2220PRS$ | {{field-5}} |"
